# urea, CO(NH2)2, low-temperature structure with H positions.
# Textbook structure written for this workbench; cell and coordinates are close to
# the 12 K neutron values of Swaminathan, Craven and McMullan, Acta Cryst. B40, 300 (1984).
data_urea
_chemical_name_common 'urea'
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P -4 21 m'
